{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20269vYPFgBzCm1792907561.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>巴西今日將舉行第二輪總統選舉投票，總統盧拉與對手，前總統博爾索納羅兒子弗拉維奧，前一日仍盡力拉票，民調顯示弗拉維奧支持度略為領先，但選情仍有隱憂。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.BRA.ELEX 1300..jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026xugBvbCOBm1792906598.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.BRA.ELEX 1300._001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026RNJOlSkjYE1792906634.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>巴西第二輪總統選舉投票前夕，多地都有拉票活動。代表左翼勞工黨、力爭連任的總統盧拉在最大城市聖保羅遊行。已經80歲的盧拉，在車上展現活力，與支持者互動。</p><p></p><p>他的對手，來自自由黨，前總統博爾索納羅的兒子，45歲的弗拉維奧就在里約熱內盧舉行集會，支持者穿上黃色上衣走上街頭。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.BRA.ELEX 1300._002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026MMRnbEINnb1792906675.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.BRA.ELEX 1300._003.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026fcVbqgd6ip1792906697.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>最新民調就顯示，弗拉維奧的支持度些微領先盧拉大約兩個百分點，分析認為，與美國總統特朗普友好的他勝出，將令巴西和其他拉美國家一樣，靠攏美國。但亦輿論指出，盧拉可能後來居上。</p><p></p><p>當地報章日前爆出弗拉維奧醜聞，指他2020年新冠疫情期間，曾獲疫苗廠商招待出席遊艇派對。在本月初舉行的第一輪投票中，弗拉維奧以百分之47的得票率，領先百分之45的盧拉。不過全國近1.6億選民中，超過兩成、即3,000多萬選民未有投票。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-25T08:23:48.137328+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":411,"images":5,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-25T05:27:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-25T08:40:32.584838+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-25T08:20:13.225881+00:00","content_hash":"5f08954ed82e566976e0be94fd47e0ce2e0f2fa5f3339022c18dbb018aae378d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-25T08:23:48.137328+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}